{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","无赦秘仪"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","赦さずの儀式"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤法阵，点亮后会给周围敌我双方施加效果。所有法阵均被点亮时施放全场法阵。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","魔法陣を召喚し、魔法陣が光り出すと、周囲の敵と味方に効果を適用。魔法陣がすべて光っている場合、魔法陣の効果範囲がフィールド全体になり、追加効果を発動"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，奎茵在战场上召唤4个法阵，每个法阵累计获得1000能量后会被点亮。法阵被点亮后，使周围2格内所有友军每秒回复奎茵40% + 8% ATK的生命值、所有敌军降低30 + 5点急速。\n主动释放时，奎茵消耗自身的能量给目标法阵充能直到它被点亮。若所有法阵均被点亮，将法阵的影响范围扩大到全场，同时降低全场敌人30% + 3%的基础属性并将其平均转移给我方角色，持续10秒；每名我方角色获得的转移属性上限为奎茵对应初始属性的45%（在挑战首领的模式中，改为固定达到该上限）。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、フィールド上に魔法陣を4個召喚。各魔法陣はSPを1000獲得すると光り出す。光る魔法陣の周囲2マス範囲内にいる味方は毎秒、エインの40% + 8% ATK分のHPを回復、敵は速度-30 + 5\nアクティブ効果：自身のSPを消費し、対象の魔法陣を光る状態までチャージ。その後、魔法陣がすべて光っている場合、10秒間、魔法陣の効果範囲がフィールド全体になり、フィールド上の敵全体の基本ステータス-30% + 3%、各ステータスの減少量を均等に味方キャラクターに移す。各味方キャラクターに移される各ステータスの上限値は、エインの対応ステータスの初期値の45%。ボス挑戦モードの場合、移されるステータスは必ず上限値になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":70,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":87,"end":91,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":160,"end":165,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":74,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":98,"end":102,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":205,"end":210,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":166,"end":170,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":71,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":194,"end":201,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵50% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至35 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣が光り出した後、味方の毎秒のHP回復量がエインの50% + 8% ATKにUPし、敵の速度減少量が35 + 5にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":54,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵60% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至40 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣が光り出した後、味方の毎秒のHP回復量がエインの60% + 8% ATKにUPし、敵の速度減少量が40 + 5にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":54,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵70% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至45 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣が光り出した後、味方の毎秒のHP回復量がエインの70% + 8% ATKにUPし、敵の速度減少量が45 + 5にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":54,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵80% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至50 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣が光り出した後、味方の毎秒のHP回復量がエインの80% + 8% ATKにUPし、敵の速度減少量が50 + 5にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":54,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","缚孽锁链"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","罪縛りの鎖"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","定身输出最高的敌人并降低其属性。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","合計与ダメージが最も高い敵に硬直を付与。さらに対象のステータスDOWN"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","将此时累计输出最高的敌人定身，并降低目标50 + 10点急速、45% + 6%护甲和魔抗，持续5秒。场上每存在1个已点亮的法阵，持续时间延长0.5秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","合計与ダメージが最も高い敵に硬直を付与し、対象は5秒間、速度-50 + 10、物理・魔法防御-45% + 6%。フィールド上の光っている魔法陣1つにつき、この効果の持続時間+0.5秒"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","降低的急速提升至55 + 10点，降低的护甲和魔抗提升至50% + 6%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","敵の速度-55 + 10、物理・魔法防御-50% + 6%"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":12,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","降低的急速提升至60 + 10点，降低的护甲和魔抗提升至55% + 6%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","敵の速度-60 + 10、物理・魔法防御-55% + 6%"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":12,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","降低的急速提升至70 + 10点，降低的护甲和魔抗提升至60% + 6%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","敵の速度-70 + 10、物理・魔法防御-60% + 6%"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":12,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","柔泽始降"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","始まりの祝福"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时点亮一个法阵。法阵会不断通过敌人的属性降低效果充能。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、魔法陣を1つ光らせる。敵が受けている、異なる味方によるステータス減少効果の数に応じて、魔法陣のSPをチャージ"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若奎茵站在法阵上，则点亮脚下的法阵，否则点亮距离自身布阵位置最远的法阵。\n被动地，所有法阵每3秒根据2格内的敌人拥有属性降低效果的数量充能，每有1个来自不同友军的属性降低效果，法阵回复24 + 4点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身が魔法陣の上にいる場合、その魔法陣を光らせる。魔法陣の上にいない場合、自身の初期位置から最も遠い魔法陣を光らせる\nパッシブ効果：すべての魔法陣は3秒ごとに1回、周囲2マス範囲内の敵が受けている、異なる味方によるステータス減少効果1つにつき、魔法陣のSPを24 + 4回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":100,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":137,"end":141,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","法阵每次回复的能量提升至26 + 4。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣の1回ごとのSP回復量が26 + 4にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","法阵每次回复的能量提升至28 + 4。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣の1回ごとのSP回復量が28 + 4にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","法阵每次回复的能量提升至32 + 4。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣の1回ごとのSP回復量が32 + 4にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の速度UP。魔法陣がすべて光った後、追加で速度UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高3点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の速度+12。魔法陣がすべて光った後、追加で速度+3"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高4点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の速度+15。魔法陣がすべて光った後、追加で速度+4"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高18点急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高5点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の速度+18。魔法陣がすべて光った後、追加で速度+5"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","恩典裁决"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","加護と罰"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后对最虚弱的单位施加效果。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","光っている魔法陣は最も弱っているユニットに波紋を放つ"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，选择其2格范围内最虚弱的单位发射波纹，若目标为友方，则使其获得奎茵500% ATK的护盾，持续8秒，否则对其造成奎茵300% ATK的伤害。\n每有1个已点亮的法阵，额外使此技能施加的护盾和伤害效果增强10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","魔法陣が光った後、その魔法陣の周囲2マス範囲内にいる最も弱っているユニットに波紋を放つ。対象が味方の場合、対象に8秒間、エインの500% ATK分のシールドを付与。それ以外の場合、対象にエインの300% ATKのダメージを与える\n光っている魔法陣1つにつき、このスキルによるシールドとダメージの効果+10%"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":40,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":64,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":97,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“恩典裁决”使友方获得的护盾值提升至奎茵550% ATK、敌方受到的伤害提升至350%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「加護と罰」で味方に付与するシールド値がエインの550% ATKにUPし、敵に与えるダメージが350%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中每10秒，所有已点亮的法阵对场上最虚弱的单位再次发射波纹。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、10秒経過するごとに、光っている魔法陣がフィールド上の最も弱っているユニットに波紋を放つ"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“恩典裁决”使友方获得的护盾值提升至奎茵600% ATK、敌方受到的伤害提升至400%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「加護と罰」で味方に付与するシールド値がエインの600% ATKにUPし、敵に与えるダメージが400%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","使\"无赦秘仪\"施放的全场法阵持续到战斗结束，每次施放额外使友方获得霸体和伤害提高。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「赦さずの儀式」の魔法陣の効果範囲が永続的にフィールド全体になる。その後、「赦さずの儀式」を発動するたびに、さらに味方にスーパーアーマーと与ダメージUPの状態を付与"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当所有法阵均被点亮后，使\"无赦秘仪\"将法阵范围扩大到全场的效果持续到战斗结束，且后续施放时使所有友方单位进入霸体状态，且造成伤害提高5%，持续5秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","すべての魔法陣が光った後、「赦さずの儀式」の魔法陣の効果範囲が永続的にフィールド全体になる。その後、「赦さずの儀式」を発動するたびに、さらに味方全体にスーパーアーマーと「与ダメージ+5%」の状態を5秒間付与"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":75,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","寂灭裁杖"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","寂滅の杖"]]}